


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_cdbdfd23:


    "熄灯后的房间。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_8eb0c428:


    "一丝不挂的祥子坐在床上，仰望窗外的月亮。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_ccff0f47:



    voice "2SA_1179"
    sachiko "「哈啊。这不已经是午夜了嘛～」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_6149cdd6:



    voice "2SA_1180"
    sachiko "「哈哈，真有活力啊你。和乃绘瑠她不同」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_f4421552:


    "床上的圣夜子轻鼾阵阵。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_d063df58:



    voice "2SA_1181"
    sachiko "「啊痛痛痛，姐姐我已经腰痛了……」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_4a91b914:


    "祥子说着，摸了摸自己的腰。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_3fe06919:


    "被闯入房间的圣夜子要了几次后的结果就是这个。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_a54455b9:



    voice "2SA_1182"
    sachiko "「……我也太好说话了」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_6c3b69bf:


    "就是啊。真的太好对付了。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_d2145b1e:


    "祥子晃晃悠悠地从床上起身后，拿起桌上的香烟，正打算点燃。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_f77821fa:



    voice "2MI_1286"
    miyako "「你的背部没有翅膀的痕迹啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_f4c47988:


    "背后传来声音。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_7755074e:



    voice "2SA_1183"
    sachiko "「嗯？吵醒你了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_73f90080:


    "圣夜子在床上摇了摇头。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_c9b16e34:



    voice "2SA_1184"
    sachiko "「我的已经完全消失了。你还有一点算是天使」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_7a575b7c:


    "听祥子这么说，圣夜子扭过脖子，想要查看自己的背部。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_cfafd360:



    voice "2SA_1185"
    sachiko "「翅膀的痕迹会随着时间推移而变淡消失的。就像记忆一样」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_6b9f82ac:


    "祥子说着，缓缓吐出一口烟雾。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_828a715e:



    voice "2SA_1186"
    sachiko "「喜欢上别人的时候，就会越来越傻」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_e255275b:



    voice "2MI_1287"
    miyako "「？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_886e4a09:



    voice "2SA_1187"
    sachiko "「在这小小的脑袋里塞入容量可观的爱情，其他的东西立马就会被覆盖掉」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_18b44a4c:



    voice "2MI_1288"
    miyako "「乃绘瑠同学也说了一样的话呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_662abd1f:



    voice "2SA_1188"
    sachiko "「毕竟我说的话都是从她那借来的……」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_a4e3e9db:



    voice "2MI_1289"
    miyako "「不对。是因为乃绘瑠同学还活在你心里」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_c67f92ea:



    voice "2SA_1189"
    sachiko "「………」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_19140307:



    voice "2MI_1290"
    miyako "「所以，就算你变成恋爱白痴后也不会忘记她。每当想起她时，关于她的记忆又会复苏」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_9c1d9dcd:


    "这孩子……"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_37639840:



    voice "2MI_1291"
    miyako "「什么时候和我说说乃绘瑠同学的事情吧。我也想让她存在于我的脑海里」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_ab10b45e:


    "谢谢。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_eb5e63bd:



    voice "2SA_1190"
    sachiko "「那……回头再说」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_d1332cee:



    voice "2MI_1292"
    miyako "「又来了～」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_da75efc7:



    voice "2SA_1191"
    sachiko "「嘿嘿」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_6a549c03:



    voice "2MI_1293"
    miyako "「……如果，我不是这个容貌，你还会喜欢上我吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_d412e9c6:



    voice "2SA_1192"
    sachiko "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_57cc96f9:


    "祥子一言不发地弯下身，凑近脸亲了亲圣夜子。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_6eb36cc7:



    voice "2MI_1294"
    miyako "「……一股烟味」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_59ccb76f:


    "圣夜子用手指摸着嘴巴。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_814be330:



    voice "2MI_1295"
    miyako "「哈。不准吸烟。为了健康着想，请你戒烟！」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_d7cd2d8f:


    "圣夜子回过神来，想要抢走祥子的烟。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_9076f912:



    voice "2SA_1193"
    sachiko "「突然之间怎么了？生活指导？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_667333b2:



    voice "2MI_1296"
    miyako "「是的！」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_90e25fef:



    voice "2SA_1194"
    sachiko "「你要是管太严，我可会丢下你消失不见哦？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_5619d4ef:



    voice "2MI_1297"
    miyako "「你不会的。因为你是胆小鬼」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_79bacd4b:


    "她说着，笑了起来。不错嘛。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_eec22b81:



    voice "2SA_1195"
    sachiko "「……咕，没想到你这么难对付」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_c69d3cf4:



    voice "2MI_1298"
    miyako "「人类可是有身体的哦？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_2d0add7e:


    "圣夜子引用了说话对象本人之前说过的台词。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_78322f33:



    voice "2SA_1196"
    sachiko "「我知道啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_95842fc1:



    voice "2MI_1299"
    miyako "「想尽可能和你多待在一起」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_e4b14455:



    voice "2SA_1197"
    sachiko "「……你真狡猾啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_9cc05fc3:



    voice "2MI_1300"
    miyako "「差不多也可以叫我“圣夜子”了吧？这可是你取的名字」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_a558be47:



    voice "2SA_1198"
    sachiko "「好～」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_81262825:


    "祥子把剩了大半截的香烟磨灭在了烟灰缸里。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_51c879b3:



    voice "2MI_1301"
    miyako "「那么……」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_d20eb856:



    voice "2SA_1199"
    sachiko "「诶？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_e0d53966:


    "圣夜子突然抓住了祥子的手腕往下拉。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_c0efd93c:



    voice "2MI_1302"
    miyako "「人生短暂。一起变得更傻吧。连同乃绘瑠同学的份一起！」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_15_ecdc5051:



    voice "2SA_1200"
    sachiko "「你是无底洞吗！等、等等放过我吧……休息，休息一下啊！！」"
